docs/DECISIONS-log.md:1685:## D63 · 2026-10-24 · Re-judging once a day; the first window ends on 2026-08-15
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:1689:- The window: "嗯改成 8/15 吧；然后已有的结果封存，然后改一下重判的设置，然后继续跑完剩下的". The results through the last completed day are sealed in `poc/data/sealed-2026-10-24-run3-through-0728/` with `SHA256SUMS`; the same views database continues from the next day to 2026-08-15 with daily re-judging.
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:1693:- Alex: "remove this", pointing to the "As of 2026-08-15" label. Remove that label from the mock header; replay dates and the stored data window stay as they are.
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:1880:- Applied on stored data: 89 Commerce notices naming China in the corpus (29 in the run window); none mentions semiconductor, server, data center, GPU, chip, NVIDIA or printed circuit (the one "heat sink" is the aluminum-extrusions scope clause); in the sealed ledger their evidence sits only under five procedural views ("will Commerce publish X by date Y": v44, v64, v65, v66, v85; 0 dependants) and u
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2007:- Decided: code (identifiers, strings, comments, docstrings), everything the system writes (ledger text, answers, labels, card fields) and every model output are English, written in English at the source. No translation layer anywhere: a Chinese text is not turned into English after the fact. The sealed ledger of 2026-10-24 is Chinese and is not rebuilt (Alex, same evening: "千万不要 rebuild 这个 db"); it 
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2073:- Scope authorized: isolated experiment code and new dated outputs. Do not rebuild the sealed ledger, change production extraction, or switch the UI while evaluating. The experiment compares vector density, recorded-graph communities, global LLM grouping, incremental grouping, and a separately declared argument-first approach; a targeted revisit diagnostic checks the observed orphaning mechanism.
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2092:- The isolated POC uses three original articles, three independent samples and ordinary-ingestion controls. New grouping fields are part of existing extraction/matching calls; original checks and writer are reused. No sealed database, production prompt, MCP or UI changes.
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2100:- Keep the same three original articles, three fresh paired samples, existing model/settings, and a total ceiling of 48 calls/$8 estimated. The control is D142's grouping path. No sealed-data rebuild, production prompt change, extra clustering call, summary, MCP or UI work. Plan and acceptance: `docs/research/2026-10-24-relation-handoff/design.md`.
docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2132:- Alex explicitly asked to keep testing from different angles, read the system design and code, and improve barriers within the existing pipeline. This authorizes continued isolated diagnosis and development POCs; no production, sealed ledger, Idea, UI, deploy or model/provider change.
