  2464	## D184 · 2026-10-26 · A candidate thesis opens for one of four reasons, stated in the answer
  2465	
  2466	- After the granularity research ([report](../reports/对冲基金论点粒度与金标.md); four notes in `research_notes/对冲基金论点粒度与金标/`): the ledger's 90 theses hold 25–32 at analyst granularity by two independent readings; the rest are financial lines, duplicates of one aggregate, customer deployments or unsettleable questions. The mechanism is one: the extractor's unit was "a sentence with a number and a period", not a disagreement; matching then rightly judged nine populations of one aggregate as nine quantities. Alex, on the clean version of option B (prompt plus schema-enforced fields, no dedup key): "可以".
  2467	- Decided: from extraction version 12 the default output for a statement is evidence to a shown thesis. A candidate opens only for one of four reasons, a closed schema enum `opens_as`: `main_driver` (an annual quantity that carries the company's value, whether or not the company guides it; first named `guidance_on_main_driver`, which the seed run showed excludes NVIDIA's data-center revenue because NVIDIA guides only quarterly), `industry_aggregate` (one aggregate quantity per calendar year; a later estimate or another population of it is evidence), `policy_stage` (a stage of a policy process with its authority named), `binding_obligation` (a guarantee, financing, equity stake or purchase commitment a universe company takes on). Every candidate also carries `settled_by` (the public material that resolves it), `folds_into` (the shown thesis it would otherwise attach to, or empty; the schema pattern is built from the shown ids) and `lost_if_folded` (the investment implication lost if it only attached there). Code checks shape (`extraction.check_admission`): blank text, an unshown `folds_into` and a binding obligation beyond its horizon are refused; the judgement of importance stays with the model (D154/D155). No key rule is added (log row 43 stands). Versions ≤ 11 are unchanged.
  2468	- The prompt `role-v12` replaces v11's "which questions to propose" with the four reasons and the three fields (7,357 characters / 1,482 o200k tokens against v11's 6,567 / 1,312: growth of 790 characters, the definitions of the three required fields and the four reasons; the recipe lines were already removed in v11, and the user message is unchanged). Configuration `poc-v25` = `poc-v23` with every category on v12. Measured against the extraction gold (D188) on the seed, week and August windows; results in `poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/`.
  2469	- Closes the open question "thesis granularity" of 05-extraction and 06-views: the research synthesis's "split when settled by different prints" and "2–4 per name" are not rules; the eight labeller rules of the report §1 are the standard, and a count is an outcome.
  2470	- Result ([results](../poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/results.md)): two false starts diagnosed on stored data ($0.08 together: a check that demanded a reason not to fold when there was nothing to fold into; reason 1 named as guidance, which excluded NVIDIA's data-center revenue), then one run over seed, week and August ($1.31 against the baseline's $1.01, the three fields and re-prepared requests). Theses 90 → 60, financial-line theses 29 → 3, evidence 534 → 710; gold full 3 → 9, partial 7 → 0, fail 10 → 11, every v12 failure a miss and none an extra. Remaining, counted: six theses for one 2026 aggregate, about seven small binding obligations, three proceedings opened as policy stages; eight candidates named a thesis in `folds_into` and opened anyway, six of them duplicates. A read-only code review's two wording findings on the role (a milestone on the main product under `main_driver`; the D185 exception beside the year limit) go to a v13 arm with the rule-2 wording for obligations and policy stages, Alex's call. Branch `feat/thesis-admission-v12`, not merged.
  2471	
  2488	## D189 · 2026-10-26 · poc-v25 is the replay default; the trace review names the next mechanisms
  2489	
  2490	- Alex, after the measurement: "你可以取代，但是看所有的 trace 然后告诉我我们怎么持续做的更好接近 golden … We don't want to overfit … It needs to act exactly like a very senior hedge fund analyst". `scripts/replay.py` now defaults to `poc/config/poc-v25.json` (extraction v12, Jev matching); `poc-v23` stays as a configuration and replays unchanged.
  2491	- The [trace review](research/2026-10-26-thesis-admission-v12/trace-review.md) reads every thesis, every gold failure and the duplicate aggregates to their raw requests, answers and matching decisions, and names the root causes by design layer: thesis identity is a quantity where the analyst's unit is a question (six 2026 aggregates, each judged "new" correctly under the current criterion); the contract under-produces on first contact with a company (AMD 2 theses, MSFT 0); the role states categories where the labeller applies tests; theme candidates name no dependant; the extractor never sees the current view. Six general mechanisms are proposed with the class and count each moves, in the order: matching's "another estimate or population of the same question" option and theme dependants (code and schema, no prompt growth), then role v13 (tests instead of lists, the first-contact rule, quarterly statements as evidence; net shorter), then showing the view in block 5 as an A/B, then the daily duplicate check as pull-mode design. Each is Alex's call; none is built here.
  2492	
  2568	## D199 · 2026-10-27 · One extraction call stays; its gate rule becomes decidable and the empty-answer exit goes (v16, poc-v32)
  2569	
  2570	- Alex, on the instability trace: "不这个一次一定是可以搞过的 → 读明白，抽取 … 这一定是prompt 的问题，你如果再拆成两步这个消耗的luna calls 太多了"; then "你要反思自己的错误，然后下去改然后马上测试啊，不要一直diverge scope". The two-call design (`docs/research/2026-10-27-two-step-extraction/design.md`, two review rounds) is recorded and not built.
  2571	- Found ([log](research/2026-10-27-single-call/log.md)): the run's 493 empty extraction answers in 1,553 calls (32%; 65% of the first week's items) were the model following the written rules: "every statement is, by default, evidence" against "link only to the thesis it directly concerns … omit statements with no thesis", decided once per page, so a customer, partner or product page was omitted whole (asked directly, the model names that rule: a national lab buying Vera Rubin CPU servers "describes a customer project, not NVIDIA's reported sales"). The five-send benchmarks before this were sent with an alphabetised schema (the archive stores sorted keys; production sends the dict as built) and overstated the empties; in production order no send of three articles was empty. A second mistake stopped the first week test: code edited while the parallel runner was mid-day.
  2572	- Decided: extraction v16 (`role-v16.txt`: one rule, "a statement is evidence to each shown thesis whose answer its fact or figure makes more or less likely", with the customer/supplier/competitor/regulator and policy cases and the omit cases; the closing line "Return empty arrays only for a page with no business content", `extraction.EMPTY_LINE_FROM`; v12's admission reasons, `V12_REASON_VERSIONS`). `poc-v32.json` is the configuration. Measured on the same 98 items of 2026-07-01..07 against the paused run (v12, whole pages): empty handovers 65% → 32%, the model's own empties 55 → 8, evidence per item 1.1 → 2.7, candidates 9 → 11, week cost $0.22. v17 (`poc-v33`, an account per mandatory paragraph in the same call) held the piece set across sends (A3: Jaccard 0.6–0.8 against 0.4–0.5) but tripled the pieces with court-case minutiae and opened 5 theses where v16 opened 11, at twice the extraction and matching cost: refuted for production, kept as the record of the shape.
  2573	- The three-month run restarts from 2026-07-01 with poc-v32 on the cleaned database (D256) in `poc/data/english-v32-nvda-3m-2026-10-27/`; the poc-v29/v30 run stays paused and untouched. Open, named: links read widely (every piece to three or four theses; D198's "links wide"), candidates for product and gaming news (no thesis list entry fits them), the cold start's "no thesis fits" drops.
